[2023 Festive Fan Art Contest with Alienware Winners Announcement]
Thank you to everyone who participated in the WitchSpring R 2023 Festive Fan Art Contest with Alienware!
We were inundated with so much fantastic fan art from fans of WitchSpring R,
that in addition to selecting winners for the prizes we previously announced,
we have also selected a handful of Judges' Choice winners.

Looking through everyone's amazing fan art made the holiday season even more joyful for us all.
Thank you to everyone who participated, and we hope you all enjoy looking at the entries!

[Note]
1) Winners will be contacted individually, and various prizes and cash awards are scheduled to be distributed between March and April 2024.
2) As previously mentioned, please understand that if it is not possible to deliver the prize to the area where the winner resides, we may not be able to provide the prize.
Meet the Winners 🔗

[Giveaway Event Winners Announcement]
We are pleased to announce the winners of the sharing event conducted through our official SNS! Due to the enthusiastic participation, additional winners have been selected as listed below. Those who have won are kindly requested to send a direct message to our official SNS account by February 20th. The prizes are scheduled to be shipped in March.

